  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Civil Society Centre, med huvudkontor i Berlin, arbetar f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad bist&#xe5;nds-och utvecklingseffektivitet i civilsamh&#xe4;llesst&#xf6;d, med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; internationella NGO:ers roll, metoder och arbetss&#xe4;tt. Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka lokalt &#xe4;garskap, involvera de mest utsatta i CSO-samarbete samt st&#xe4;rka utrymmet f&#xf6;r det civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer att verka.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Civil Society Centre, with HQ in Berlin, works to increase development effectiveness within civil society support, with a particular focus on international NGOs and their role, methods and approaches. The aim of the program is to strengthen local ownership,  involve the most vulnerable in CSO collaboration, and to increase the civic space that allow for civil society to function and work.</narrative>
  </description>
